Upstream-Name: ClassiCube default texture pack, Minecraft sounds and music
Source: http://static.classicube.net/default.zip, https://resources.download.minecraft.net/
Comment: NOT FREE. The texture pack holds the Minecraft Classic textures from Mojang's client
 jars (with ClassiCube's patches); the sounds and music are Mojang's, fetched from its resource
 server by classicube/sounds.sh as the game's launcher would. Personal and LAN use only; this
 package and its source must not be put in a public repository.

